flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:16:50.6993087Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:16:50.6993202Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:16:50.6993385Z 
